WEBVTT

00:00:03.940 --> 00:00:06.730
It was a quiet and gentle Christmas Eve...

00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:11.240
until our chance meeting
guided us into a tragic battle.

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:14.610
The truth is fading once more.

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:16.950
The shadows are flickering,

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:19.290
and wishes are stifled.

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:26.880
The tears that made her grasp the key to her
destiny have summoned a deep darkness.

00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:33.510
The curtain is quietly rising
on this long, cold night.

00:00:35.430 --> 00:00:39.310
Mahou Shoujo Lyrical
Nanoha A's will now begin.

00:02:36.710 --> 00:02:38.840
Hurry! Hurry!

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:42.970
It's too late!

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:44.060
Retreat!

00:02:46.890 --> 00:02:49.890
This is the No. 2 Transport Ship, Estia!

00:02:49.890 --> 00:02:52.310
The Book of Darkness is out of control,
and we can't stop it.

00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:56.070
It has engulfed the bridge,
as well as the reactor,

00:03:00.660 --> 00:03:04.580
Navigation systems and the
Arc-en-ciel controls have also been...

00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:08.620
Readings from the Estia indicate
that it's charging the Arc-en-ciel!

00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:11.120
It's aiming at the rest of the fleet!

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:14.960
Admiral Clyde, escape at once.

00:03:15.550 --> 00:03:17.880
You are... to abandon the Estia.

00:03:19.050 --> 00:03:22.930
I confirmed the evacuation of the
remaining crew just a moment ago.

00:03:22.930 --> 00:03:28.020
In a little over a minute, this ship's
Arc-en-ciel will be fully charged.

00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:31.310
I will send the charge countdown to you.

00:03:31.310 --> 00:03:34.310
You must stop this ship before it fires.

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:35.820
The connection is...!

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:40.610
The Estia has 68 seconds
until it is fully charged!

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:44.870
We've finished charging here...
We can fire at any time.

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:45.620
Father!

00:03:47.870 --> 00:03:50.120
Begin barrel expansion of the Arc-en-ciel.

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:55.210
We'll stop it before the Estia's
countdown drops to zero.

00:04:25.570 --> 00:04:27.370
<i>It was my mistake...</i>

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:33.540
<i>I couldn't have imagined that the rampaging
Book of Darkness would be powerful enough</i>

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:36.000
<i>to completely take over one
of our warship's systems.</i>

00:04:54.020 --> 00:04:57.020
The communications jamming barrier in
the target space has been terminated.

00:04:57.020 --> 00:04:58.560
Visuals incoming!

00:05:01.030 --> 00:05:01.820
Where's Chrono?

00:05:01.820 --> 00:05:03.740
He is currently en route to the location.

00:05:09.700 --> 00:05:12.450
Alright, the barrier's up.

00:05:12.450 --> 00:05:14.000
How are Durandal's preparations going?

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:14.750
It's ready.

00:05:22.510 --> 00:05:25.510
Diabolic Emission.

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:31.060
It's a spatial attack!

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:33.060
Merge with the darkness.

00:05:36.890 --> 00:05:38.230
Round Shield.

00:05:52.740 --> 00:05:55.250
I wonder how long those two will last...

00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:58.960
I certainly hope until it starts
going out of control, at least.

00:06:09.430 --> 00:06:10.970
Struggle Bind.

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:16.520
While restraining one's opponents, it dispels
any strong magic that may be cast on them.

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:22.520
It doesn't normally see much action,
but in times like these...

00:06:22.520 --> 00:06:24.400
it can be quite useful.

00:06:26.860 --> 00:06:30.700
Because it forcefully cancels
any transformation magic.

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:45.710
Chrono! You...!

00:06:45.710 --> 00:06:48.840
I don't remember teaching you this magic...

00:06:48.840 --> 00:06:56.600
Didn't you teach me to continue studying
and practicing on my own, Aria, Lotte?

00:07:04.650 --> 00:07:06.110
<i>Hiding, are they?</i>

00:07:11.110 --> 00:07:13.200
Nanoha, I'm sorry...

00:07:13.200 --> 00:07:14.240
and thank you.

00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:15.160
Are you all right?

00:07:15.160 --> 00:07:16.200
Yeah.

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:17.120
I'm fine.

00:07:18.870 --> 00:07:21.540
It looks like she's an expert
with wide-area attacks.

00:07:21.540 --> 00:07:24.380
It'll be difficult to dodge
all of her attacks...

00:07:24.380 --> 00:07:25.130
Bardiche.

00:07:25.920 --> 00:07:27.210
Yes, sir.

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:29.130
Barrier Jacket. Lightning Form.

00:07:33.090 --> 00:07:33.840
Here.

00:07:36.760 --> 00:07:37.930
Hayate-chan...

00:07:46.320 --> 00:07:47.270
Nanoha!

00:07:47.270 --> 00:07:48.150
Fate!

00:07:49.900 --> 00:07:51.990
Yuuno-kun! Arf-san!

00:07:52.700 --> 00:07:56.740
Master... I will grant your wish.

00:07:58.740 --> 00:08:03.580
My beloved guardian knights... I will now...

00:08:05.080 --> 00:08:07.340
destroy the ones who hurt you.

00:08:08.550 --> 00:08:10.840
Gefängnis der Magie.

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:22.180
What was that?!

00:08:22.180 --> 00:08:24.520
It's like last time.
A barrier that keeps us trapped inside!

00:08:24.520 --> 00:08:28.440
It's as we thought... she's after us.

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:31.570
Chrono's searching for a way to finish this.

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:34.530
Backup is also on the way,
but there's still some time until they arrive.

00:08:34.530 --> 00:08:38.030
So we're on our own until then, huh?

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:43.040
Nanoha...

00:08:45.460 --> 00:08:46.540
Everything will be fine.

00:08:49.550 --> 00:08:51.880
Sleipnir.

00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:53.050
Spread your wings.

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:55.050
Sleipnir.

00:09:11.030 --> 00:09:14.610
The Liese twins were under
orders from you, weren't they...

00:09:15.530 --> 00:09:16.990
Admiral Graham?

00:09:16.990 --> 00:09:18.410
You're wrong, Chrono!

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:21.870
We did this all on our own.
Father had nothing to do with it!

00:09:21.870 --> 00:09:25.710
Lotte, Aria.
It's all right.

00:09:25.710 --> 00:09:29.170
Chrono essentially knows
everything that's going on.

00:09:29.170 --> 00:09:30.460
Am I mistaken?

00:09:32.840 --> 00:09:36.720
Ever since the previous
Book of Darkness case eleven years ago,

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:42.010
you've been independently searching for its new incarnation. Haven't you, Admiral?

00:09:42.010 --> 00:09:46.640
And then you found it.
The location of the Book of Darkness...

00:09:46.640 --> 00:09:49.730
and its current master, Yagami Hayate.

00:09:49.730 --> 00:09:54.190
But even if you suppressed the Book
and its master before its completion...

00:09:54.190 --> 00:09:55.740
it wouldn't have made any difference.

00:09:55.740 --> 00:09:59.620
Even if you captured the
master or destroyed the Book,

00:09:59.620 --> 00:10:02.240
it would just recreate itself elsewhere.

00:10:03.660 --> 00:10:07.670
That's why you kept an eye on them and
waited for the Book to be completed.

00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:11.500
You've found one, haven't you?

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:14.760
A method to permanently
seal the Book of Darkness?

00:10:17.130 --> 00:10:24.010
Her parents died and her body was broken,
so it really tore my heart apart, but...

00:10:24.010 --> 00:10:26.350
I thought it was her destiny.

00:10:27.180 --> 00:10:28.940
She was all alone in the world,

00:10:28.940 --> 00:10:32.020
so at least no one had to grieve for her.

00:10:32.020 --> 00:10:38.780
You also said you were her father's friend,
and provided for her, didn't you?

00:10:39.410 --> 00:10:44.870
I wanted her to be happy before we
had to lay her to eternal rest, at least.

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:49.580
It was my hypocrisy.

00:10:49.580 --> 00:10:51.920
Your means of sealing it...

00:10:51.920 --> 00:10:53.960
is to freeze both it and its master,

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:57.970
and trap them in a frozen limbo
world through a dimensional rift.

00:10:58.880 --> 00:11:00.340
It's something like that, isn't it?

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:01.640
Yes...

00:11:01.640 --> 00:11:07.350
That way, the Book's reincarnation
functions wouldn't work.

00:11:07.350 --> 00:11:12.560
All of its previous masters have
been vaporized by the Arc-en-ciel!

00:11:12.560 --> 00:11:14.520
Nothing has changed!

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:17.650
Chrono, it's not too late.

00:11:17.650 --> 00:11:19.900
Release us already.

00:11:19.900 --> 00:11:24.620
We can only freeze them in the few
minutes when it starts to go out of control!

00:11:24.620 --> 00:11:28.080
But until that happens,
the master of the Book of Darkness

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:31.080
is not yet a horrible criminal deserving
the punishment of being eternally frozen.

00:11:32.120 --> 00:11:32.880
That's illegal.

00:11:32.880 --> 00:11:34.380
Because of that...!

00:11:34.380 --> 00:11:38.050
Because of that law, this tragedy
has been allowed to repeat itself.

00:11:38.050 --> 00:11:41.630
Even Clyde-kun...
even your father had to–

00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:43.340
Lotte.

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:55.360
There's another problem with your
plan besides its legality, Admiral.

00:11:55.360 --> 00:12:00.740
First of all, releasing them from that frozen
existence shouldn't be all that difficult.

00:12:00.740 --> 00:12:03.780
No matter where you hide it, no matter how
much you try to protect it from everyone...

00:12:04.820 --> 00:12:08.200
someone will find it one day,
and try to use it as their own.

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:12.540
Anger and sadness...
Greed and despair...

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:15.460
Such wishes will lead people to it...

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:17.090
To that sealed power...

00:12:20.510 --> 00:12:24.970
I'm worried about what's happening
out there, so I will have to excuse myself.

00:12:26.720 --> 00:12:27.220
Chrono.

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:28.850
Yes?

00:12:29.350 --> 00:12:31.810
Aria, give him Durandal.

00:12:31.810 --> 00:12:32.640
Father!

00:12:32.640 --> 00:12:34.690
No way...

00:12:34.690 --> 00:12:37.820
We don't have a chance anymore.

00:12:37.820 --> 00:12:39.820
It is useless in our hands now.

00:12:42.070 --> 00:12:45.410
I'll let you decide how you want to use it.

00:12:47.240 --> 00:12:50.740
It's the Staff of Freezing, Durandal.

00:13:24.450 --> 00:13:25.200
Breaker.

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:32.330
Plasma Smasher.

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:34.330
Fire!

00:13:34.870 --> 00:13:37.580
Divine Buster Extension.

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:39.330
Shoot!

00:13:44.510 --> 00:13:45.510
Shield.

00:13:45.510 --> 00:13:47.010
Panzerschild.

00:13:53.640 --> 00:13:57.390
Bring forth spears infused with blood.

00:13:58.310 --> 00:13:59.900
Blutiger Dolch.

00:14:02.230 --> 00:14:05.110
Pierce them.
Bloody Dagger.

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:22.250
I summon the light of destruction
down upon my prisoners.

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:30.640
It couldn't be...

00:14:30.640 --> 00:14:31.430
That's...!

00:14:32.260 --> 00:14:33.680
Stars, gather...

00:14:34.770 --> 00:14:37.520
and become the light which pierces all.

00:14:37.980 --> 00:14:41.060
Starlight... Breaker?

00:14:44.570 --> 00:14:46.070
Arf, Yuuno!

00:14:46.650 --> 00:14:47.490
Got it!

00:14:52.320 --> 00:14:55.200
Tear through the world in a blaze of light.

00:14:55.200 --> 00:14:58.040
To use Nanoha's magic...!

00:14:58.040 --> 00:15:02.210
Nanoha's been absorbed by it before.
It must've copied this move from her then!

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:04.210
Fate-chan!

00:15:04.210 --> 00:15:06.000
I don't think we have to go this far...

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:09.220
If we take that point-blank,
it'll tear right through our defenses.

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:11.010
We need to get as far away as we can!

00:15:21.310 --> 00:15:25.190
on the left at 300 yards.
Sir, there are noncombatants

00:15:31.490 --> 00:15:33.870
As I thought, there's
nobody over there, either!

00:15:33.870 --> 00:15:36.160
Everyone just vanished...

00:15:38.160 --> 00:15:40.120
It got so dark, too...

00:15:40.120 --> 00:15:41.870
and there's something
glowing up there...

00:15:41.870 --> 00:15:43.790
What's going on here?!

00:15:44.960 --> 00:15:47.130
For now, let's run!

00:15:47.130 --> 00:15:48.590
As far as we can possibly go!

00:15:48.590 --> 00:15:49.670
Y-Yeah.

00:15:57.060 --> 00:15:59.560
Distance: 70.

00:16:00.600 --> 00:16:02.060
60.

00:16:02.060 --> 00:16:02.980
Nanoha...

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:03.560
50.

00:16:03.560 --> 00:16:04.440
Dropping you here.

00:16:04.440 --> 00:16:05.110
Yeah.

00:16:14.870 --> 00:16:16.030
20.

00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:18.290
18.

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:30.550
Umm... excuse me!

00:16:30.550 --> 00:16:33.720
It's dangerous around here,
so please just stay where you are!

00:16:34.840 --> 00:16:36.220
That voice just now was...

00:16:39.770 --> 00:16:41.730
Nanoha...?

00:16:41.730 --> 00:16:43.310
Fate-chan...?

00:16:51.240 --> 00:16:55.240
Starlight Breaker.

00:17:08.750 --> 00:17:10.710
<i>Fate-chan, can you take care of
Arisa-chan and Suzuka-chan?</i>

00:17:10.710 --> 00:17:11.630
<i>Yeah!</i>

00:17:13.090 --> 00:17:15.550
Stay still, you two!

00:17:15.550 --> 00:17:16.970
Defenser Plus.

00:17:24.180 --> 00:17:25.100
Raising Heart!

00:17:26.770 --> 00:17:28.940
Wide Area Protection.

00:17:43.660 --> 00:17:45.120
<i>Nanoha!</i>

00:17:45.120 --> 00:17:46.670
<i>Nanoha, are you all right?!</i>

00:17:46.670 --> 00:17:47.830
<i>Fate?!</i>

00:17:50.040 --> 00:17:52.340
<i>We're fine, but...!</i>

00:17:52.340 --> 00:17:57.380
<i>Arisa and Suzuka are...
trapped inside the barrier!</i>

00:17:57.380 --> 00:17:58.890
What?!

00:18:00.390 --> 00:18:01.180
Amy-san!

00:18:01.510 --> 00:18:05.020
Once the effects of the blast die down,
I'll get them out right away!

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:06.350
Try to bear with it for now!

00:18:06.350 --> 00:18:07.270
Okay!

00:18:17.900 --> 00:18:19.700
Everything's okay now.

00:18:20.370 --> 00:18:25.580
We'll take you somewhere safe soon,
so just sit tight a little longer!

00:18:26.410 --> 00:18:29.210
Umm... Nanoha-chan, Fate-chan...

00:18:29.210 --> 00:18:30.420
Hey! What's—

00:18:37.010 --> 00:18:38.880
They saw us like this, didn't they?

00:18:38.880 --> 00:18:40.220
Yeah...

00:18:40.220 --> 00:18:42.550
<i>Yuuno-kun, I'm sorry.</i>

00:18:42.550 --> 00:18:45.180
<i>Could you protect the two of them for me?</i>

00:18:45.180 --> 00:18:46.600
<i>You too, Arf.</i>

00:18:46.600 --> 00:18:48.560
<i>But, Fate!</i>

00:18:48.560 --> 00:18:49.810
Let's go, Arf.

00:18:49.810 --> 00:18:51.100
But...!

00:18:51.100 --> 00:18:54.690
If they have to worry about us, they
won't be able to fight to their limits, so...

00:18:57.110 --> 00:18:58.820
<i>Nanoha-chan!
Fate-chan!</i>

00:18:58.820 --> 00:19:00.110
<i>I just got in touch with Chrono-kun!</i>

00:19:01.070 --> 00:19:02.910
<i>Get the Book's master...</i>

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:06.040
<i>Try to get Hayate-chan
to surrender and stop!</i>

00:19:06.830 --> 00:19:08.410
Yeah.

00:19:08.410 --> 00:19:09.330
<i>Okay!</i>

00:19:10.790 --> 00:19:15.800
<i>Hayate-chan and Book of Darkness-san...
Please stop this!</i>

00:19:15.800 --> 00:19:20.300
<i>We aren't the ones who hurt
Vita-chan and the others!</i>

00:19:20.300 --> 00:19:23.100
<i>Signum and the rest... we...!</i>

00:19:23.100 --> 00:19:27.100
My master wishes that this world...

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:34.480
the world that took away her loved ones be
turned into nothing more than a nightmare.

00:19:34.940 --> 00:19:38.990
I am simply granting that wish.

00:19:38.990 --> 00:19:45.240
My master is in an eternal slumber
within her gentle dreams.

00:19:45.990 --> 00:19:51.710
And to those two who
stole her precious knights...

00:19:53.750 --> 00:19:55.380
eternal darkness.

00:19:55.380 --> 00:19:56.630
Book of Darkness-san!

00:19:57.250 --> 00:20:02.130
So you... also call me by that name.

00:20:17.360 --> 00:20:18.530
But that is fine...

00:20:22.070 --> 00:20:26.450
I am only here to grant my master's wish.

00:20:26.450 --> 00:20:30.000
Only here to grant her wish?

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:36.750
Will Hayate-chan really be
happy if you grant this wish?!

00:20:36.750 --> 00:20:38.750
Keeping your heart locked away...

00:20:38.750 --> 00:20:43.720
and being nothing... but a tool to grant your
master's wish, with no feelings of your own...

00:20:43.720 --> 00:20:46.720
Are you really okay with that?!

00:20:46.720 --> 00:20:51.220
I am a magical tome.
I am nothing but a tool.

00:20:51.220 --> 00:20:54.600
But you can use words, can't you?!

00:20:54.600 --> 00:20:56.270
You have a heart, don't you?!

00:20:56.270 --> 00:20:59.110
It wouldn't be right if you didn't!

00:20:59.110 --> 00:21:03.780
If you didn't have a heart,
you wouldn't be crying right now!

00:21:03.780 --> 00:21:07.910
These tears are my master's tears.

00:21:07.910 --> 00:21:10.540
I am a tool.

00:21:10.540 --> 00:21:14.290
I have... no sadness.

00:21:14.920 --> 00:21:16.500
Barrier Jacket, purge!

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:18.460
Sonic Form.

00:21:25.430 --> 00:21:27.260
You have no sadness?

00:21:27.260 --> 00:21:33.850
You say those words with such a
sad face... who would believe you?!

00:21:34.390 --> 00:21:37.310
You also have a heart!

00:21:37.310 --> 00:21:39.810
It's okay to admit that you're sad!

00:21:39.810 --> 00:21:46.320
Your master... Hayate-chan
will surely answer to that!

00:21:46.320 --> 00:21:48.200
She's a really kind girl!

00:21:48.200 --> 00:21:51.330
So please, release Hayate.

00:21:51.330 --> 00:21:52.830
Stop your attacks!

00:21:52.830 --> 00:21:54.040
Please!

00:22:09.720 --> 00:22:11.850
That didn't take long...

00:22:11.850 --> 00:22:14.850
The destruction has already begun...

00:22:14.850 --> 00:22:18.560
Soon I will lose consciousness...

00:22:18.560 --> 00:22:22.230
Once that happens, I will go berserk.

00:22:22.230 --> 00:22:29.240
While I still have my consciousness,
I shall grant my master's wish.

00:22:30.240 --> 00:22:32.120
Blutiger Dolch.

00:22:36.120 --> 00:22:38.870
Sink... into the darkness.

00:22:46.380 --> 00:22:48.380
You whiny brat!

00:22:49.130 --> 00:22:50.390
Sonic Drive...

00:22:51.890 --> 00:22:53.640
Listen...

00:22:53.640 --> 00:22:54.760
...Ignition.

00:22:55.600 --> 00:22:56.600
...to what we have to say!

00:22:59.480 --> 00:23:04.480
You shall also sleep within me.

00:23:15.240 --> 00:23:16.450
Fate-chan!

00:23:21.880 --> 00:23:23.340
Absorption.
Absorption.

00:23:24.460 --> 00:23:29.970
Everything will fall into a tranquil slumber.

00:25:09.320 --> 00:25:12.820
The Book of Darkness
has trapped Fate-chan...

00:25:12.820 --> 00:25:16.490
and Hayate-chan
continues to sleep within it.

00:25:16.490 --> 00:25:20.370
On this holy night, memories of my past
and sadness rain incessantly down.

00:25:20.990 --> 00:25:23.710
